pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# FB-12.3 gate (#479): the fh1-race inputs on a seed whose Gauntlet is
# restricted to 1980s cars, a copy of the appdata-2026-09-27 seed with an
# enabled mod shipping db/10-limit.sql:
#   update EventRestrictions set Value = '0003000004000007BC000007C5'
#     where EventID in (29, 43, 66);
# (event 71's year limit; run tools/build-mod-patches.py on the copy). With
# --pinyon_shift_cheats=true --cheat_any_car_events=true the ticket reads
# CURRENT CAR ELIGIBLE, the 1994 Miata stays selected, the race starts and
# cheat.applied names the event. Without the cheat the ticket reads GARAGE
# CARS ELIGIBLE, car select offers only the 1983 Audi Sport quattro and the
# race HUD check fails.
# The class: the same inputs on a seed whose mod instead sets
#   update Events set TargetClass = 2 where Id = 43;
#   update EventRestrictions set Value = '0000000000' where EventID = 43;
# (class D, no other limits). With the cheat the A 600 Miata races as it is; without it
# car select offers to fit it to D 299 and the race HUD check fails.
# clock-hz 60
# expect-race-hud-any race-ready race-moving
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
